## Summary

This PR collects the Windows-first Runner UX fixes identified while dogfooding local MCP providers on MSI/Blender.

- make `run_detached_process` easier for the model to discover and select for work that must survive Runner restart;
- make Windows local MCP provider bootstrap explicit and usable without inherited shell environment assumptions;
- recover retired MCP provider connections on later explicit requests without replaying failed work;
